VERDICT: PASS -- ARP lease probing is honoured exactly on the wire on every graded limb:
         the enable, type, packet-count and timeout settings each change what the DUT
         transmits, an answered probe withholds the address and records the conflict, and
         the no-forms restore the documented defaults.
  probe enable / no probe enable .... honoured    (0 probes disabled vs 3 probes enabled)
  probe packets N ................... honoured    (N=3 -> 3 probes; N=0 -> 0 probes)
  probe timeout T ................... honoured    (T=1000 ms -> gaps 0.995 s, 1.001 s)
  probe type arp vs probe type ping . distinct    (answered ARP withholds under arp; under
                                                   ping it escalates to ICMP instead)
  answered probe .................... address withheld  (.102 under arp, .106 under ping:
                                                   no OFFER, no ACK)
  probed address == offered address . yes         (every leg, on a fresh chaddr)
  conflict recorded ................. show ip dhcp binding holds .102 with empty ClientId
  show ip dhcp pool ................. reports all four probe settings and their defaults
  no probe type/packets/timeout ..... Ping / 5 / 200 restored, probe lines gone from the
