  reboot ............................ ARP / 3 / 1000 survive and still probe on the wire
CAVEAT:  Every leg was driven from one host NIC on a single VLAN 10 access port, so only a
         LOCALLY CONNECTED client was exercised; probing on behalf of a relayed, non-local
         client was not measured. probe timeout was measured at 1000 ms only, and probe
         packets at 3 and at the 0 boundary only -- the documented ranges were not swept.

